                <figcaption class="text-dim">With Olivia Graeve at the ENLACE closing ceremony — Certificate of Participation, “High-performance processor design for artificial intelligence”, 26 June – 11 August 2023, La Jolla, CA.</figcaption>
              </figure>

              <section class="space-y-2">
